OL,3,GNEWSAFestive switch-on after businesses
OL,4,Atake on lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses have formed a new chamber of
OL,7,Ftrade to help bring Christmas lights to
OL,8,FDover after criticism of last year's
OL,9,Ffestive display.
OL,11,FA Christmas lights switch-on featuring
OL,12,Fmusic and pantomime entertainment is
OL,13,Ftaking place on Saturday after a tree
OL,14,Fwas installed in Market Square.
OL,16,FDominic Morris, a founding member of
OL,17,Fthe Dover Chamber of Trade, said he and
OL,18,Ffellow businessman Travis Skelton
OL,19,Fdecided to set up the organisation
OL,20,Fafter last year's Christmas projections
OL,21,Fby Dover Town Council attracted
OL,22,Fcriticism.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
