OL,3,GNEWSAFestive switch-on after businesses
OL,4,Atake on lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FMorris said he was "over the moon" when
OL,7,Fhe saw this year's lights installed.
OL,8,FThe BBC has contacted the town council
OL,9,Ffor comment.
